 **Surface Elevation (`#ffffff`):** Work surfaces, active inspectors, modal sheets, and data tables.\n- **Sidebar Surface (`#f4f4f5`):** Docked navigation strip providing tactile separation from data panes.\n- **Dividers & Structural Borders (`#e1e3e7`):** Precision 1px grid alignments that maintain architectural division without visual heaviness.\n- **Deep Ink Primary Text (`#24272b`):** High-clarity typography for maximum readability across complex data sets.\n- **Muted Subtext (`#6b6f79`):** Secondary meta-information, property labels, and column headers.\n\n### Functional Status Tokens\n- **Accent Primary / Informational:** Text/Icon `#1657b8`, Container Surface `#edf4ff`.\n- **Operational Success:** Text/Icon `#087b58`, Container Surface `#e8f6ef`.\n- **Warning / Review Required:** Text/Icon `#92580b`, Container Surface `#fff5e4`.\n- **Critical / Deprecated:** Text/Icon `#ac3535`, Container Surface `#fff0f0`.\n\n### Agent Multi-Model Identifiers\n- **AIPro:** Ink `#1657b8`, Tint `#edf4ff`.\n- **Claude:** Ink `#b94b29`, Tint `#faede8` (Warm Terracotta).\n- **Gemini:** Ink `#6a3ebd`, Tint `#f3ecff` (Structured Violet).\n- **Codex:** Ink `#464a53`, Tint `#eceef1` (Graphite Slate).\n\n## Typography\n\nThe typographic hierarchy prioritizes systematic density, legibility, and geometric vertical balance. Rendered with an enterprise system-sans profile (Inter / Segoe UI metric stack), the scale enforces crisp vertical alignment inside compressed row heights and split-pane inspectors.\n\n- **Monospace Integration:** JetBrains Mono is assigned exclusively to runtime parameters, skill IDs, schema versions, and endpoint configurations to avoid character ambiguity.\n- **Visual Weighting:** Semantic emphasis relies on transitioning from `400` to `500` or `600` weight rather than arbitrary scale jumps.\n- **Scale Compactness:** Headline scale is deliberately constrained (peaking at 20px) to maximize real-estate efficiency within a standard desktop display frame.\n\n## Layout & Spacing\n\nThe architectural layout utilizes a structured desktop shell targeting a primary canvas viewport of 1440×900 and scaling dynamically.\n\n### Shell Matrix\n- **Window Chrome Titlebar:** 32px fixed height across the entire upper perimeter. Hosts the application brand mark, document caption, global search quick-jump, and platform native window controls (minimize, maximize, close).\n- **Navigation Dock (Sidebar):** Fixed width of exactly 225px. Spans the vertical height immediately beneath the titlebar, containing system grouping, skill catalogs, and environmental presets.\n- **Main Working Stage:** Dynamic fluid grid split into master inventory panes (flexible `1fr`) and an optional collapsible inspection drawer (fixed 380px).\n- **Rhythm & Grid:** Built upon a 4px/8px incremental cadence. Gaps between form controls, table cells, and panel borders honor compact information grouping without edge crowding.\n\n## Elevation & Depth\n\nVisual separation is constructed using **low-contrast structural outlines** alongside subdued, planar tonal changes rather than high-deflection drop shadows.\n\n- **Level 0 (App Base Canvas):** `#fafafa` base surface.\n- **Level 1 (Docked Panels & Data Tables):** `#ffffff` with a crisp `1px solid #e1e3e7` border. No drop shadow.\n- **Level 2 (Active Dropdowns & Flyout Menus):** `#ffffff` surface, `1px solid #e1e3e7`, accompanied by an ambient boundary blur: `box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(36, 39, 43, 0.08)`.\n- **Level 3 (Modal Dialogs & Confirmation Overlays):** `#ffffff` surface with `box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(36, 39, 43, 0.16)`. Overlays render over a darkened backdrop wash (`rgba(36, 39, 43, 0.35)`).\n\n## Shapes\n\nThe design system employs a **Soft** geometric shape posture (`roundedness: 1`), projecting an engineered, institutional presence.\n\n- **Panels, Windows, & Cards:** 4px border radius (`0.25rem`). This provides slight corner smoothing while retaining strong rectangular structure along screen divisions.\n- **Form Fields & Standard Buttons:** 4px border radius (`0.25rem`).\n- **Status Badges & Model Indicators:** 3px border radius for compact rectangular tags, or fully round (circle) for pure dot telemetry.\n- **Modal Containers:** 6px border radius (`0.375rem`) to signify independent layering above the root desktop frame.\n\n## Components\n\n### Titlebar & Window Chrome\n- **Container:** 32px height, background `#f4f4f5`, border-bottom `1px solid #e1e3e7`.\n- **Window Controls (Right):** Horizontal button trio (Minimize, Maximize, Close) with 44px width each. Close button shifts background to `#ac3535` with white iconography on hover; minimize/maximize shifts to `#e1e3e7`.\n- **Title Caption:** Center-aligned or left-docked with 12px Medium type in `#24272b`, coupled with a subtle lockup icon.\n\n### Buttons & Actions\n- **Primary:** Background `#1657b8`, foreground `#ffffff`, height 28px or 32px, horizontal padding 12px, border-radius 4px. Hover: `#124491`.\n- **Secondary / Neutral:** Background `#ffffff`, border `1px solid #e1e3e7`, foreground `#24272b`. Hover: background `#f4f4f5`, border `#d2d5dc`.\n- **Destructive:** Background `#fff0f0`, border `1px solid #ac3535`, foreground `#ac3535`. Hover: background `#ac3535`, foreground `#ffffff`.\n\n### Badges, Chips & Agent Indicators\n- **State Badges:** Padding 2px 6px, font-size 11px, font-weight 500, line-height 14px, radius 3px.\n  - Active: `#087b58` on `#e8f6ef`.\n  - Staging/Paused: `#92580b` on `#fff5e4`.\n  - Error/Revoked: `#ac3535` on `#fff0f0`.\n- **Agent Provider Indicator:** A dual-element capsule. Displays a 6px solid dot indicator beside the provider label:\n  - *AIPro:* Dot `#1657b8`, background `#edf4ff`, text `#1657b8`.\n  - *Claude:* Dot `#b94b29`, background `#faede8`, text `#b94b29`.\n  - *Gemini:* Dot `#6a3ebd`, background `#f3ecff`, text `#6a3ebd`.\n  - *Codex:* Dot `#464a53`, background `#eceef1`, text `#464a53`.\n\n### Data Tables & Property Sheets\n- **Header Cells:** Background `#f4f4f5`, height 28px